{"3421620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "STACK-eRZ", "steam_appid": 3421620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STACK-eRZ is a Roguelite game that follows the story of a mercenary for hire.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you will be able to equip your character with several accessories that alter how your attacks and powers work in order to clear randomly chosen zones for you to discover and fight the enemies within it. STACK-eRZ also includes leveling system and upgrading your character after at the base of operations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About STACK-eRZ</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STACK-eRZ is a roguelite game which uses isometric view with a cyberpunk and at times cartoonish visuals. The leveling system is based on Role Playing Games in which you can have a quick way to boost your character depending on the situation you are in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421620/extras/c3a568188999e6165d85d2cd9bc97399.poster.avif?t=1779624399\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421620/extras/c3a568188999e6165d85d2cd9bc97399.webm?t=1779624399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421620/extras/c3a568188999e6165d85d2cd9bc97399.mp4?t=1779624399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ different zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >63+ character altering accessories </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >222 different items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >131 passive skill points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive unlock of skills and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different skills for each character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests/Contracts for additional rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421620/extras/8c5f44df19fd8b644296439d0e05977b.avif?t=1779624399\" width=400 height=225 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STACK-eRZ is a Roguelite game that follows the story of a mercenary for hire.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you will be able to equip your character with several accessories that alter how your attacks and powers work in order to clear randomly chosen zones for you to discover and fight the enemies within it. STACK-eRZ also includes leveling system and upgrading your character after at the base of operations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About STACK-eRZ</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STACK-eRZ is a roguelite game which uses isometric view with a cyberpunk and at times cartoonish visuals. The leveling system is based on Role Playing Games in which you can have a quick way to boost your character depending on the situation you are in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421620/extras/c3a568188999e6165d85d2cd9bc97399.poster.avif?t=1779624399\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto